# Testing

Details: `docs/onboarding-tour/TESTING.md`.

## Unit / widget (`flutter test`)
- `test/blocs/` — `TutorialCubit` (incl. Previous landing rules), timer pause
  holds, combat pause sync.
- `test/helpers/` — `TourProgress`, combat tutorial scripts,
  `foldable_devices.dart` (13 window profiles with hinges/folds).
- `test/layout/` — `GameLayout.resolve` matrix, `GameLayoutBody` on every
  profile, `GamePauseGuard`, keypad gaps (`keypad_spacing_test.dart`).
- Prefer tests that derive expectations from data (`TutorialScript`,
  `TourProgress.menuSteps`) over hard-coded indices.

## Integration (`flutter test integration_test/<file> -d <device>`)
- One `testWidgets` per file (`app.main()` singletons don't tear down).
- `tour_guide_test.dart` — the whole tour, every step forwards **and back**:
  title, "Part · n / N" label, card on screen, buttons tappable, highlight on
  screen and < 50 % covered, seeded `TurnBloc`/`CombatBloc` data. Lessons are
  completed from `TutorialScript` (tap Next / key / answer, or wait), so it
  needs no edits when lessons change. Screen via dart-defines: `IPAD`,
  `LANDSCAPE`, `FOLD_COVER`, `FONT_SIZE` (forced sizes also clear the
  device's own hinge).
- `foldable_walkthrough_test.dart` — every screen at a foldable's native
  window (`SKIP_SHOTS`, `COLLECT_OVERFLOWS`).
- `screen_walkthrough.dart` / `*screenshot*_test.dart` — store screenshots via
  `flutter drive` + `test_driver/screenshot_driver.dart`.
- Any `RenderFlex overflowed` fails an integration test — fix the layout,
  don't silence it.

## Gotchas
- Wait for state, not time: poll blocs (`waitUntil`) and let cards settle
  (pages slide in) before measuring layout.
- Tap with `.hitTestable()` finders; a covered widget (e.g. "Later" under the
  tour) otherwise receives the tap meant for what's on top.
- Simulator screenshots via `simctl` are blank during integration tests —
  capture `renderView.debugLayer` to a PNG inside the test.
- `Foldable_7_6`: `adb emu posture 1|2|3`; closed still reports the inner
  display, so use `--dart-define=FOLD_COVER=true` for the cover screen.
- Clear `.dart_tool/flutter_build`, `build/` and Xcode DerivedData when a
  build fails with "No space left on device".
